{"id":"exposto","lemma":"exposto","pos":"adj","rank":3623,"glosses":["exposed","visible, manifest, patent"],"ipa":"/ɐjʃˈpoʃ.tu/","forms":{"feminine":"exposta","masculinePlural":"expostos","femininePlural":"expostas"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom foi exposto ao perigo.","en":"Tom was exposed to danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/963479","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Ele estava exposto a muitos perigos.","en":"He was exposed to many dangers.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"very, a lot","l":"muito"},{"g":"danger","l":"perigo"}]},{"text":"Aqueles livros estavam expostos na vitrina.","en":"Those books were on display in the window.","words":[{"g":"that over there, yon","l":"aquele"},{"g":"book","l":"livro"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"O Tom foi exposto ao perigo.","en":"Tom was exposed to danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/963478","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Não fique exposto ao sol por longos períodos de tempo.","en":"Don't stay out in the sun for long periods of time.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"long","l":"longo"},{"g":"period","l":"período"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]}]}